### 1) Valid registration -> expect 201
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mina",
  "email": "Mina@Example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass123"
}

### 2) Same email again -> expect 409 EMAIL_TAKEN
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Someone Else",
  "email": "mina@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass123"
}

### 3) Invalid input -> expect 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "123"
}

### 4) Broken JSON -> expect 400 INVALID_JSON
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email":

### 5) Mass assignment attempt -> expect 201 but role CUSTOMER
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hacker",
  "email": "hacker@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass123",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}


### 6) Login OK (email case differs) -> expect 200 + Set-Cookie
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "MINA@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass123"
}

### 7) Wrong password -> expect 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mina@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword1"
}

### 8) Unknown email -> expect the SAME 401 message
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nobody@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass123"
}

### 9) Invalid input -> expect 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": ""
}


### 10) Me after login -> expect 200 with user (no passwordHash)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me

### 11) Logout -> expect 200 + Set-Cookie that clears the token
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/logout

### 12) Me after logout -> expect 401 UNAUTHENTICATED
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me

### 13) Forged cookie -> expect 401 UNAUTHENTICATED
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me
Cookie: token=this.is.not-a-real-token